The baseline methods originate in the following projects:
  Flow-GRPO     https://github.com/yifan123/flow_grpo
  DiffusionNFT  https://github.com/NVlabs/DiffusionNFT
  ReFL          introduced with ImageReward, https://github.com/zai-org/ImageReward
  DiffusionOPSD https://github.com/worldbench/DiffusionOPSD

Some of the derived files carry further upstream sources, named in their
headers and inherited from DiffusionOPSD:
  mend/sampling/sd3_logprob.py, mend/sampling/sd3_prompt_encoding.py
      Hugging Face Diffusers, https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers
      (Apache-2.0; the HuggingFace copyright header is kept)
  mend/rewards/clip_scorer.py
      imscore, https://github.com/RE-N-Y/imscore
  mend/rewards/aesthetic_scorer.py
      improved-aesthetic-predictor,
      https://github.com/christophschuhmann/improved-aesthetic-predictor

All other files (the mend.algorithm package, the evaluation suite and analysis
tools, scripts/generate.py, infra/, configs/mend.py, the guides and the tests)
are original to MEND.

Base models, reward models and datasets are not redistributed here. They are
downloaded by the user and remain under their own terms.
